@startuml Data Flow - Document to Answer
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title Data Flow: From Document Upload to AI Answer

state "1. Document Upload" as Upload #LightBlue {
    state "User selects file" as S1
    state "Request presigned URL" as S2
    state "Upload to B2" as S3
    state "Confirm upload" as S4
    
    S1 --> S2
    S2 --> S3: uploadUrl
    S3 --> S4: file stored
}

state "2. Background Processing" as Process #LightGreen {
    state "Download from B2" as P1
    state "Extract text" as P2
    state "Chunk text" as P3
    state "Generate embeddings" as P4
    state "Store in Qdrant" as P5
    
    P1 --> P2: fileStream
    P2 --> P3: fullText
    P3 --> P4: chunks[]
    P4 --> P5: embeddings[]
}

state "3. Document Ready" as Ready #Yellow {
    state "Status = Completed" as R1
    state "Vectors in Qdrant" as R2
    state "Metadata in PostgreSQL" as R3
    
    [*] --> R1
    R1 --> R2
    R1 --> R3
}

state "4. User Ask Question" as Question #LightCoral {
    state "User types question" as Q1
    state "Embed question" as Q2
    
    Q1 --> Q2
}

state "5. Hybrid RAG Retrieval" as Retrieval #LightCyan {
    state "Search Qdrant" as V1
    state "Query PostgreSQL" as V2
    
    [*] --> V1: Top 3 chunks
    [*] --> V2: Task stats
}

state "6. LLM Generation" as Generation #LightYellow {
    state "Build context" as G1
    state "Call Groq LLM" as G2
    state "Generate answer" as G3
    
    G1 --> G2: systemPrompt + context
    G2 --> G3: LLM response
}

state "7. Return to User" as Return #LightGreen {
    state "Answer + Sources" as Ret1
    state "Task Summary" as Ret2
    state "Processing Time" as Ret3
    
    [*] --> Ret1
    [*] --> Ret2
    [*] --> Ret3
}

Upload --> Process: trigger background job
Process --> Ready: success
Ready --> Question: document available
Question --> Retrieval: questionEmbedding
Retrieval --> Generation: context data
Generation --> Return: final response

note right of Upload
**Step 1-4**
Time: ~1-2 seconds
(excluding background)
end note

note right of Process
**Step 4 (Background)**
Time: ~5-15 seconds
- Text extraction
- Chunking
- Batch embedding
- Qdrant upsert
end note

note right of Retrieval
**Parallel Queries**
- Vector search: ~0.5s
- SQL query: ~0.1s
Total: ~0.6s
end note

note right of Generation
**LLM Call**
Time: ~1-3 seconds
Model: llama-3.3-70b
Context included
end note

@enduml
